  hintId: tutorial_range
  isUnlockedByDefault: 0
  ignoreLock: 1
  title: Range
  image: {fileID: 0}
  description: "The <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color>()</font>
    function can also receive <color=yellow>parameters</color> to control the generated
    sequence of numbers. If the parameter is only one, then it's <font=\"JetBrainsMono
    SDF\">End value</font>\n\n<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color>(Start
    value<color=#D4D4D4>,</color> End value<color=#D4D4D4>,</color> Step value)</font>\n\nExamples:\n<indent=2em>-
    <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color>(<color=#B5CEA8>5</color>)</font>
    \u2192 Generate numbers from <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>0</color></font>
    to <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>4</color></font></indent>\n<indent=2em>-
    <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color>(<color=#B5CEA8>2</color><color=#D4D4D4>,</color>
    <color=#B5CEA8>5</color>)</font> \u2192 Generate numbers from <font=\"JetBrainsMono
    SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>2</color></font> to <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>4</color></font></indent>\n<indent=2em>-
    <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#F5F5AB>range</color>(<color=#B5CEA8>0</color><color=#D4D4D4>,</color>
    <color=#B5CEA8>10</color><color=#D4D4D4>,</color> <color=#B5CEA8>2</color>)</font>
    \u2192 Generate numbers from <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>0</color></font>
    to <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>8</color></font> with a step of
    <font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\"><color=#B5CEA8>2</color></font></indent>\n\nThe first
    iteration starts with the Start value, then the next iteration adds the Step
    value (<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\">i <color=#D4D4D4>+=</color> step</font>).
    The loop will stop if (<font=\"JetBrainsMono SDF\">i <color=#D4D4D4>>=</color></font>
    End value)."
  isImageBig: 0
